  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MBA Agri Food</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to introduce 15-20 AgriFood MBA students from Kyiv Mohyla Business School (KMBS) to the best practices in Dutch agribusiness and value-added food processing. This will help to bridge the gap between the practical training of AgriFood students and the modern agribusiness market. Additionally, it will assist Dutch agribusinesses in overcoming the strategic challenges they face when doing business in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
